# Eco-Warrior (Windurst) (windurst 84): the EcoReset lock until the next conquest tally. Completed at Lumomo (822:
# EcoReset 1, its expiry NextConquestTally(): the harness's JST clock starts on a Friday at 17:00, so the tally is the
# Monday 00:00 JST after it, 1800198000). Then nil (EcoReset 1); two JST days later (Sunday 17:00, before the tally:
# still nil); one more day (Monday 17:00, past the tally: EcoReset reads 0): 818, option 1 deletes the quest and begins
# it again.
lists WindurstWaters/Lumomo/onTrigger WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/818 WindurstWaters/onEventFinish/822
char zone=WindurstWaters pos=-55.8,-4.5,20.9 lvl=30
quest Windurst.EcoWarrior accepted
keyitem IndigestedMeat
login
trigger Lumomo                            # the meat: 822
finish                                    # completed; EcoReset 1 until the next conquest tally
trigger Lumomo                            # completed, EcoReset 1: nil; 819
finish-if-event
wait jst=2
trigger Lumomo                            # Sunday 17:00 JST, before the tally: EcoReset 1: nil; 819
finish-if-event
wait jst=1
trigger Lumomo                            # Monday 17:00 JST, past the tally: EcoReset 0: 818
finish option=1                           # the quest deleted and begun again
